  "problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\operatorname{cot}⁡x?$ Assume $n$ is an integer.\n\nI. The domain of the function is $(-\\infty ,+\\infty ).$\n\nII. $\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x)=\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x-\\pi )$\n\nIII. The function has a vertical asymptote at $x=-5\\pi .$",
